{"title":"2022 CEMC TUC Problems/Practice Relay Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Replace <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> below with the number you receive.\n</p><p>How many of the following numbers are divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/2/3b2bc2831c0a9b7e6e2e437334c47de269d8c61c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[15\\text{, }92\\text{, }40\\text{, }N\\text{, }105\\text{, }140\\text{, }19\\]\" width=\"202\" height=\"16\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_2\" title=\"2022 CEMC TUC Problems/Practice Relay Problem 2\">player 2</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/0/20033726c4f1ec68918c6660d04791ff669645ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N = 25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"61\" height=\"14\" />. This makes the list:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/c/00c4375f5adf42a279edda9b2a9ddb2840906ca9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[15\\text{, }92\\text{, }40\\text{, }25\\text{, }105\\text{, }140\\text{, }19\\]\" width=\"204\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>From this, we see that the numbers divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/78792fe4680a164f537ea72a4f900e4471433c3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/66644fd9f411299c3c1eabf151b5f601c9ef6c21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/1/791f15f656db201fa9116a2f762a4b292fc50883.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$105$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/5/0b51850ccd3440214d4ccfbc14d29b2a31bfda55.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$140$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> because they all end in a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> or a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/7/897a203bdf45af36f2b9edc59c3bc0beeb898be1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"20\" height=\"23\" /> numbers here.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_TUC\" title=\"2022 CEMC TUC\">2022 CEMC TUC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_TUC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC TUC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_TUC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC TUC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_2\" title=\"2022 CEMC TUC Problems/Practice Relay Problem 2\">Practice Relay Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_4\" title=\"2022 CEMC TUC Problems/Practice Relay Problem 4\">Practice Relay Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CE